mbat. Set on the Palpagos Islands, players capture and tame animal-like creatures called Pals, which can be used as mounts, combat partners, or workers at player-built bases. The game incorporates firearms and darker satirical elements into the monster-taming formula.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/palworld", "videos": [{"id": 69839, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "kXhsorMwAFo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kXhsorMwAFo", "title": "Palworld Gameplay Trailer | Future Game Show 2022", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kXhsorMwAFo/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 74774, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "7tVwvbv6GjE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7tVwvbv6GjE", "title": "Palworld TGS 2022 Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7tVwvbv6GjE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 91322, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "f1-i0lqJVRQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f1-i0lqJVRQ", "title": "Palworld - Official Release Date Announcement Trailer (4K) | Summer Game Fest 2023", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/f1-i0lqJVRQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 98317, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "sg_HDQd-kgM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sg_HDQd-kgM", "title": "Palworld - Gameplay Trailer | TGS 2023", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sg_HDQd-kgM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 104605, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "tOatviGVCTs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tOatviGVCTs", "title": "Palworld | Early Access Release Date Announcement Trailer | Pocketpair", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tOatviGVCTs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 107379, "name": "Game Preview Launch Trailer", "video_id": "uV0zfAwazcs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uV0zfAwazcs", "title": "Palworld | Game Preview Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uV0zfAwazcs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 11115